Section: text
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: StackSync Solutions <support@stacksyncsolutions.com>
Installed-Size: 45000
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31), libstdc++6 (>= 11), libqt6core6 (>= 6.5.0), libqt6gui6 (>= 6.5.0), libqt6widgets6 (>= 6.5.0), libqt6network6 (>= 6.5.0), libqt6printsupport6 (>= 6.5.0)
Homepage: https://www.stacksyncsolutions.com/
Description: Professional, modular, offline-first PDF productivity suite
 PDFinity is an enterprise-grade desktop PDF application engineered in modern
 C++20 and Qt 6 by StackSync Solutions with Jake Ashley Panlilio as Lead Programmer.
 Designed from the ground up for absolute document integrity, memory safety,
 and complete data privacy, PDFinity operates 100% offline with zero cloud accounts,
 zero telemetry, and zero hidden network transmissions.
 .
 Features include universal rendering, page assembly, annotation studio,
 AcroForms filler, content editing, PKCS#7 digital signing, irreversible
 redaction, offline OCR, format conversion, and headless batch CLI automation.
